sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant B as Broker
    participant W as Worker terpilih

    C->>B: REQ 1 50000 (diakhiri \n)
    Note over B: pilih_worker()<br/>rr atau least
    B->>W: REQ 1 50000 (diteruskan apa adanya)
    alt worker hidup
        Note over W: app_id 1 = LONG<br/>hitung prima <= 50000
        W-->>B: OK 1 5133
        Note over B: terlayani[1] + 1
        B-->>C: OK 1 5133
    else worker mati / tidak membalas
        B-->>C: ERR worker 1 tidak merespons
    end
